Name: Google APIs TypeScript Client (Discovery, OAuth2, Cloud, Workspace, Vertex AI & Gemini)
Short Name: googleapis
URL: https://github.com/googleapis/google-api-nodejs-client
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Version: 148.0.0
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/google-api-nodejs-client
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/google-api-nodejs-client

Description:
Official Google APIs client library covering Google Cloud (project=aphrody, Secret Manager, KMS, Storage, Cloud Run, BigQuery, Spanner, Vertex AI), Google Workspace (Drive, Gmail, Docs, Sheets, Calendar, People), and Gemini APIs.

Local Modifications:
- Re-architected for 100% Native Upstream Bun v1.4.4+ fetch() + WebCrypto OAuth2/OIDC JWT & Passkeys PRF without Node.js http/https polyfills.
- Exposed as a native Bun.plugin virtual module (yolo-bun:googleapis).
